- # Database and Model Constraints

- NEVER attempt to update, migrate, or modify the database schema. Do not create, edit, or run database migrations.
- NEVER modify Alembic migration files in `Server/migrations/versions/`.
- NEVER execute database migration commands (e.g., `flask db migrate`, `flask db upgrade`, `alembic upgrade`, etc.).
- ONLY allow edits to files in `Server/app/models/` directory. All other Server files are read-only unless explicitly requested by the user.
- When working with model files, only modify the Python model definitions themselves - do not attempt to change the underlying database structure.
